Fix: In web/js/state.js renderDaysPanel(), change line 692 from:
  label.className = 'day-row-label';
to:
  label.className = 'day-row-label day-title';
This makes the .day-title CSS rule apply to the rendered label span. Verify with Playwright: document.querySelector('.day-title') must be non-null and computed fontSize must be '14px', fontWeight '600'.
